the inverse identities and derivative formula displayed above are separately proved. Neither route
claims invariance of BFGS under a nonlinear scalar transform. It includes cases whose scalar second
derivative is unbounded at zero. Finite sums of differently powered gauges are instead covered by
the radial argument in Chapter 4, including 1 < p < 2.

