7.1 Scope and main conclusions
This note continues the investigation of ordinary, full-memory BFGS under the algorithmic formu-
lation in Xie–Wächter [1]. The accepted steps satisfy fixed Armijo and weak Wolfe inequalities.
Accepted iterates are differentiable; the inverse matrices are positive definite; no damping, restarts,
smoothing, spectral safeguards, or particular line-search implementation is imposed.
The principal family is

