7.1.3 Theorem 7.C: complete iterate dichotomy in the planar unbounded-below case
For a finite max-linear objective on R2 with inf f = −∞, every infinite admissible run satisfies
exactly one of

                                            xk −→ 0,         f (xk ) ↓ 0,

or

