Moreover, all subsequent steps belong to the fixed subspace HK S. To see this, initially HK S is
the image of S; if Hk S ⊂ HK S, then sk ∈ HK S, and the inverse update maps S back into HK S,
since gk , yk ∈ S. Induction proves the claim.
