Relation to earlier work
The following comparisons are bibliographic scholarship, separate from the formal theorem assertions.
For the special case u2 + |v|, Guo–Lewis proves a subsequence approaching the nonsmooth axis, not
full convergence (Corollary 4.4) [10]. The theorem in this chapter treats the complete stated finite
family. Gebken’s related quasi-Newton conclusions retain behavior assumptions [5]; no historical
priority claim follows from this comparison.




