used for the embedding. The initial matrix is supplied by the stable manifold, not assumed to be I
in these particular coordinates.

This is an existence proof of an actual trajectory, not a claim that a numerically truncated stable
eigenvector produces it forever. Expanding eigenvalues make ordinary floating-point forward
shooting an inappropriate certificate of membership in the stable manifold.




